<title>USA: BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN GAME 6, WORLD SERIES.</title>
<headline>BASEBALL-YANKEES WIN GAME 6, WORLD SERIES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the sixth game of</p>
<p>the World Series on Saturday:</p>
<p> New York Yankees     3   ATLANTA BRAVES     2</p>
<p>(New York wins best-of-seven series 4-2)</p>
</text>
